ncreases life of expensive blower fans and motors.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Better Air Quality:</b> Removes pathogens and outdoor pollutants.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Compliance:</b> Helps in clearing industrial safety and hygiene audits.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-red-50 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border-l-8 border-red-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-red-800\">Disadvantages of Neglect (Cons)</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-3\">\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Product Contamination:</b> Risks spoilage in food processing environments.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Mechanical Failure:</b> Unexpected bearing seizures causing plant shutdown.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>High Operational Costs:</b> Dirty filters lead to motor strain and high bills.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Odor Issues:</b> Bacteria buildup leads to foul smells in office areas.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Water Leakage:</b> Clogged drains causing ceiling damage.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Health Risks:</b> Spread of airborne diseases among workforce.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Warranty Void:</b> Lack of service logs voids manufacturer warranty.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ERROR CODES -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-center\">Common AHU Error Codes &#038; Solutions</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:border-blue-500\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600\">E1: Static Pressure High</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm\"><b>Solution:</b> Replace clogged HEPA/Pre-filters. Check for blocked duct dampers.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:border-blue-500\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600\">E5: Fan Motor Overload</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm\"><b>Solution:</b> Verify VFD settings. Inspect blower wheel for debris or imbalance.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:border-blue-500\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600\">E9: Condensate Alarm</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm\"><b>Solution:</b> Flush the primary drain line. Clean the &#8220;P&#8221; trap in the AHU room.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:border-blue-500\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600\">F0: Refrigerant Leak</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm\"><b>Solution:</b> Professional leak detection on cooling coils and pressure testing.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FAQS -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-gray-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-10 text-center\">Anand AHU Service FAQs</h2>\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">1. Do you provide AHU service in Vallabh Vidyanagar?</h4>\n                    